{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Blazing Hot High-speed Meteor Action in Chaotic Space!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >METEORA is Inspired by the imagined Universes of classic space movies and science documentaries. Set billions of years ago, in an agitated, nascent universe; you are a meteor fighting for survival in a violently changing world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manoeuvre your way through asteroid belts, meteor barrages and other space events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155220/extras/5afed852bea570cdc16bd2f4fd98a2eb.poster.avif?t=1775146526\" width=540 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155220/extras/5afed852bea570cdc16bd2f4fd98a2eb.webm?t=1775146526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155220/extras/5afed852bea570cdc16bd2f4fd98a2eb.mp4?t=1775146526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dodge, Chase &amp; Plan Your Takedowns</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is a constant looming threat - watch and dodge the other meteors closing in behind you, while chasing the ones ahead and setting yourself up to take them down. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create and Customize your own Meteor shower</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155220/extras/49a094f59dc0594d9142c3ebece91ad3.poster.avif?t=1775146526\" width=540 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155220/extras/49a094f59dc0594d9142c3ebece91ad3.webm?t=1775146526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155220/extras/49a094f59dc0594d9142c3ebece91ad3.mp4?t=1775146526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Possess &amp; create your own meteor shower to destroy your opponents all at once! Players can customize their meteor shower formation to maximize the damage and increase their chances of survival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock, upgrade, combine power-ups &amp; Abilities to survive and conquer along your journey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use various power-ups obtained by dashing into power-up elements out in space. Strategize your power-up pick-ups and combine them in real-time to get an edge over the opponents seeking to destroy you! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience A Fraction of the Universe Each Level</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155220/extras/10d2b92e6543bb88fb3c8c3544ff56ba.poster.avif?t=1775146526\" width=540 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155220/extras/10d2b92e6543bb88fb3c8c3544ff56ba.webm?t=1775146526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155220/extras/10d2b92e6543bb88fb3c8c3544ff56ba.mp4?t=1775146526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your skills and instincts to test with harder difficulties and unlock hidden boss-challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brave a supermassive black hole, destroy a planet, save a sun and much more as you experience this catalytic universe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the Beginning of the Universe</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1155220?t=1775146526","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155220/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1775146526","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155220/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775146526","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155220/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775146526","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN THE DISCORD</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Blazing Hot High-speed Meteor Action in Chaotic Space!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >METEORA is Inspired by the imagined Universes of classic space movies and science documentaries. Set billions of years ago, in an agitated, nascent universe; you are a meteor fighting for survival in a violently changing world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manoeuvre your way through asteroid belts, meteor barrages and other space events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155220/extras/5afed852bea570cdc16bd2f4fd98a2eb.poster.avif?t=1775146526\" width=540 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155220/extras/5afed852bea570cdc16bd2f4fd98a2eb.webm?t=1775146526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155220/extras/5afed852bea570cdc16bd2f4fd98a2eb.mp4?t=1775146526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dodge, Chase &amp; Plan Your Takedowns</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is a constant looming threat - watch and dodge the other meteors closing in behind you, while chasing the ones ahead and setting yourself up to take them down. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create and Customize your own Meteor shower</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155220/extras/49a094f59dc0594d9142c3ebece91ad3.poster.avif?t=1775146526\" width=540 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155220/extras/49a094f59dc0594d9142c3ebece91ad3.webm?t=1775146526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155220/extras/49a094f59dc0594d9142c3ebece91ad3.mp4?t=1775146526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Possess &amp; create your own meteor shower to destroy your opponents all at once! Players can customize their meteor shower formation to maximize the damage and increase their chances of survival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock, upgrade, combine power-ups &amp; Abilities to survive and conquer along your journey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use various power-ups obtained by dashing into power-up elements out in space. Strategize your power-up pick-ups and combine them in real-time to get an edge over the opponents seeking to destroy you! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience A Fraction of the Universe Each Level</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155220/extras/10d2b92e6543bb88fb3c8c3544ff56ba.poster.avif?t=1775146526\" width=540 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155220/extras/10d2b92e6543bb88fb3c8c3544ff56ba.webm?t=1775146526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155220/extras/10d2b92e6543bb88fb3c8c3544ff56ba.mp4?t=1775146526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your skills and instincts to test with harder difficulties and unlock hidden boss-challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brave a supermassive black hole, destroy a planet, save a sun and much more as you experience this catalytic universe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the Beginning of the Universe</p>","developers":["Big Boot Games LLP"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155220/5ece757a28b65ffcc685d92c58da3cf236e7a5b4/header.jpg?t=1775146526","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"METEORA - \u00a9 2023. Developed by Big Boot Games LLP. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"METEORA","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-4330 @ 3.50GHz / AMD FX-4330<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 770 / AMD R9 270X<br></li><li><strong>Dir